OL,3,AWilliam and Kate meet PM Modi as they
OL,4,Awrap up India tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Fmet India's prime minister as they
OL,8,Fended their three-day visit to the
OL,9,Fcountry.
OL,11,FNarendra Modi thanked Prince William
OL,12,Ffor bringing his Earthshot prize to the
OL,13,Fcountry during the couple's first
OL,14,Finternational tour since 2022.
OL,16,FIt comes a day after the royal couple
OL,17,Fgave out #1m prizes to winners of the
OL,18,Fenvironmental award, which was founded
OL,19,Fby the prince and remains one of his
OL,20,Fbiggest personal projects.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
